=== Fatigue Phenotypes and Subgroups

<subsec:fatigue-phenotypes>

Fatigue in ME/CFS does not behave as a single uniform construct. Symptom-structure and clustering analyses suggest it is embedded within coherent multi-system symptom clusters and that severity-based subgroups exist, with some molecular evidence of differentiation from other fatigue states.

